{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d6b3f333ce893947589629c09b17401133452f2339df2b03987ff98db34bc016", "ja": "（次回公演に向けて、今日は律子の初衣装合わせだ。\n演出も決まってきたし、これから忙しくなるぞ！）", "zh": "（为了准备下次公演，律子今天要试穿服装。\n公演的演出流程也决定了，接下来会变忙啰！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c07eacf74473f625dbf4d34eb828de1ffa19f4b877f6abe4eca94ad863d076ac", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\n今、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "工作辛苦了，{$P$}。\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "76f517e144464a9c7bc32471b6b9e1b884e19c4fe8f690a0dc0deaa7fa1461e6", "ja": "律子、お疲れさま。どうした？", "zh": "律子，辛苦了。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "d5f786a28e3b2e5819d898a757169ca9a098966cd726a08592a239761e0d87b2", "ja": "えっと……次の公演って、私のアイディアを\n全面的に取り入れてもらえるってことでしたよね？", "zh": "就是……关于下次公演，\n会全面采用我提出的想法对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aa9bf0376c889837db4558f7b5d24e6fa6bad417329eceac02352a462ccdfb82", "ja": "ああ。律子が「今のムーブメントはアートですよ！」\nって言ってきた時は、どうしたのかと思ったけど……。", "zh": "对啊。你跑来跟我说「现在的趋势就是艺术！」的时候，\n我还以为发生什么事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "430091d44dd3e393ac504813dbbcf2edb9eb905302d9eabc11463e0fb92a1568", "ja": "ステージのデザインも、ライトアップも斬新だし、\n面白くなりそうだよな！", "zh": "不过你提出的舞台设计和灯光都十分新颖，\n我想应该会很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "c031937e308c11451ddecb262913a40818ca352caeaa37a8e95956194b7aedc2", "ja": "ええ、私もそう思ってます！　……でも。\n私の出した企画と違うところもありますよね？", "zh": "是啊，我也这么觉得！\n……可是，有些地方和我提出的企画不太一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cf014f4e5ed4b76ecf4ed8276acc4cc80a322b96e20989467b3fcf5cf1d40a36", "ja": "えっ。かなり忠実だと思うけど……。\nどこが違ったんだ？", "zh": "有吗？我觉得都很忠实地呈现了……\n哪边不一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "5ddd0aac7ee26aaf2c2517e812426b1ffbeb3302923392bb5fdb445005f8102a", "ja": "とぼけないでください。\n私の出番、倍になってるじゃないですかぁ！", "zh": "请你不要装蒜了。\n我的出场时间变成两倍啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a73200285fc02da371f426541f9658fcf7d587fec66c1d35cb7be91b00fb0b66", "ja": "ああ。ええと、それは……\nうん、元のままじゃ少なすぎると思って。", "zh": "啊对。呃呃，那是因为……\n嗯，我觉得你原本规划的时间太短了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "dfcaaeca82f2d23bd7ff56c56166fc4e28618f188aef989d3e49d3bf918050fb", "ja": "少なすぎませんよ！　あれぐらいがベストなんです！\nその分、CGを使った演出もたくさんできるし！", "zh": "才不会呢！那个长度才是最合适的！\n其他很多地方可以使用CG来替代啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "fea80d2967463fbf85bf24b540dc1df1bc7d1a03a218499fab3d8c7ca25a2114", "ja": "古風な演出に頼ってたら、今時の刺激に慣れた\nお客さん達は、ついてきてくれませんよ？", "zh": "光靠老派的舞台效果，\n是吸引不了习惯现代刺激的观众的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "c10139febcd0c3718b290410871f8b2ff197ba6b0356861f3bb8482c0154189e", "ja": "そもそも！　出番を増やすにしたって、\n倍はないでしょ、倍は！", "zh": "话又说回来！就算要增加上场的时间，\n也没人会加到两倍吧？两倍耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1013_p", "source_sha256": "407ea0b60f3684396c9a2cfa361e2d52f035b719e83d5bb096f14ee5074e67fa", "ja": "……つまり、主な苦情は最後の一言だよな？", "zh": "……其实你想抱怨的只有最后这一句吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "8eae2cc3358cdf013623756a36b716a17d2e9acb33bb963d8a0e9f41728f3f72", "ja": "え！？　そ、そういうわけじゃ……\nないこともないですけど……。", "zh": "什么！？我、我才没有……\n但也不能完全否定啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "36a878abe3774cf73c626081876b0a851650082cc54c35dd705a540ea787a56b", "ja": "とにかくっ！　納得のいく理由を聞かせてください。\nでなきゃ、出番は戻してもらいますからね！", "zh": "不管怎样！请给我一个可以接受的理由。\n不然就请你把时间调整回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2870ce35696fa2446fd4bb367dd1b7009226532bc36028d4f1b6346c1da38619", "ja": "うーん……ま、律子の言うことも、正しいと思う。\n流行を読み解くことは、確かに大切だし。", "zh": "唔……的确，律子你说得非常正确。\n理解时下的流行确实很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "12a52e3a9ce2c73f40490f4434df0b583a53327fbafeb8788b932e8525453659", "ja": "でも、流行ってのは追うだけじゃなくて、\n作り出していかないと。追ってるだけじゃダメだ。", "zh": "不过，我们不能顾着追逐流行，\n得自己创造新东西，不能只是盲目追随。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "ec74425e141407b60109c5af036cec7dd502083de0e19fbb87d7336ad921ec1f", "ja": "うっ。まぁ、それは確かに、そうだと思いますけど……\nあれ？　それで私の出番が増えたってことは……", "zh": "呜，也是啦，你说得没错……\n等等，你之所以增加我的出场时间，该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "ce632af3edbc6a7eb5fe14a38f600924ae5c8165945b1d679e639613e27cc73a", "ja": "まさか、私のパフォーマンスで、\n流行を作り出せるって言いたいんですか！？", "zh": "该不会是觉得我的表演\n可以创造新的流行吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e9eae2027f7d04bc5b249bbc2be2d4fb9cad14a7029295eb815ac6ff1e25270c", "ja": "その通り！　律子の人気も出てきてるし、\n今なら仕掛けていけると思うんだ。", "zh": "正是如此！律子，你的人气也越来越高了，\n我认为现在应该能成功推动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5c12a2e9bbd32abfc8548b4048138f8314f8efc1bce1d28624efb61a873c02cb", "ja": "新しい衣装も作ったことだし。この辺りで\n流される側じゃなく、流す側に挑戦して行こう！", "zh": "而且也做了新的服装。现在我们不该随波逐流，\n而是挑战创造潮流！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "d43e35c863ff3c0335a92e20b5697a31a081d37b3e829348d14f892fe9d3ff32", "ja": "ふ～ん……威勢がいいのは結構ですけど……。\nふふっ、了解しました。燃えてきたわぁ！", "zh": "这样啊……我欣赏你的气势……\n呵呵，我知道了。我燃起斗志啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "744fc2e6d4e736854521011ec522a539e4138326f17649acb20f266b1cfe2450", "ja": "それじゃ、今回は乗せられておきます。\nただし！", "zh": "好吧，这次我就配合你。\n可是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "af6203b474a3b8d144da8f2a6d36231e6303143c2a2c6df56bd15ad9ba9b8986", "ja": "今後の具体的な計画も、\nあとでじっくり、たっぷり聞かせてもらいますからね。", "zh": "待会你要好好地跟我解释清楚\n以后的具体计划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0064_1025_p", "source_sha256": "14ce4b6d54f1ad05b5e017dc93f76f12e13eb8f185fb60d02b37f39a2a8fea9e", "ja": "（どうにか納得してくれた。\nさて、急いで次の計画を立てないと……！）", "zh": "（总算是说服她了。\n好，要赶紧拟定接下来的计划才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
